Third-party data
===============

data/wordbooks/cet4.tsv and data/wordbooks/cet6.tsv are derived from
mahavivo/english-wordlists (https://github.com/mahavivo/english-wordlists),
distributed under the MIT License. The lists were downloaded and parsed by
scripts/fetch-wordlists.py, then merged with the hand-written layer in
data/wordbooks/curated/.

Example sentences, collocations, synonyms and etymology notes in
data/wordbooks/curated/ and data/wordbooks/*.examples.tsv were written for
this project.
